box 23 4 25    26 17 25   trunk
box 22 4 26    27 17 27   trunk
box 23 4 28    26 17 28   trunk
box 24 4 29    25 17 29   trunk

# Coconuts hanging
v 28 16 26   coco
v 28 16 27   coco
v 21 16 26   coco
v 21 16 27   coco
v 24 16 23   coco
v 25 16 30   coco

